From: C2000MAX local driver maintenance
Subject: [PATCH 021] Fix TTLM control format and current-element dispatch

Accept the one-octet default control, bounded optional fields and presence
bitmap payloads. Parse atomically, preserve the caller beacon timestamp,
and mark emitted per-TID maps as explicit instead of default.

Dispatch the current TTLM extension only, check the IE header before Len,
and reject a supplied malformed STA cache before disconnecting. The fixed
zero cache still means no supplied IE. No new mapping negotiation is added.
The pointer parser API requires a complete bounded IE from its caller.

